# Wall segment: a 2x3x2 m physical barrier - no field, no power, just mass and health.
# Placed as a drag LINE (segments every 2 m along the path). Enemy units gnaw through it or
# go around; a cheap way to shape their approach. Spawned origin 1.5 above ground.
# SHAPE: cut stone with a darker capstone. The baseshapes have no 3 m piece and a scale is uniform, so the body is two
# 2 m cubes that overlap: the root's (1.5 m under the origin to 0.5 over it) and `Upper` (to 1.5 over it).
Prefab gameWall
	Global true
	Component Render
		ObjectContainer baseshapes
		Node Cube
		Type StaticMesh
		Color 0.5 0.48 0.44
		Position 0 -0.5 0
		Scale 1
	Component Physics
		Body Static
		ContactEvents true
		Shape Box
		HalfExtents 1 1.5 1
	Component GameStructure
		MeleeRadius 1
	Component Scene
		Entity
			Name Upper
			Position 0 0.5 0
			Component Render
				ObjectContainer baseshapes
				Node Cube
				Type StaticMesh
				Color 0.5 0.48 0.44
				Scale 1
		Entity
			Name Cap
			Position 0 1.26 0
			Component Render
				ObjectContainer baseshapes
				Node CubeQuarter
				Type StaticMesh
				Color 0.36 0.35 0.33
				Scale 1.04
